# Sacred Live-Cell Hero

The homepage `.sc-hero` 3D turning cell is a product-critical surface.

## Hard rules

1. **Never** replace `index.html` live-cell hero with blueprint/calc-sheet/theme mocks.
2. **Never** load obsolete `sc-hero-cell.js?v=16`, `v22`, or `v23`. Always use immutable `sc-hero-cell-v24.js` (bump filename on intentional hero changes).
3. **Never** reintroduce the flat SVG chuck poster. Poster must be `hero-cell-poster.png`.
4. **Never** early-return WebGL on `prefers-reduced-motion` — only slow motion.
5. **Never** make RoomEnvironment/PMREM required — env map failure must not kill WebGL.
6. **Never** reintroduce the oval ground disc / soft mirror plate or rear metal bay plate — they block clean 360° orbit.
7. SEO injectors, EEAT, calc-sheet, and deploy scripts must not rewrite hero markup/scripts.
8. After any `npm run build` / Firebase promote, run `node scripts/verify-hero-sacred.mjs` and confirm live loads `sc-hero-cell-v24.js` with canvas `.is-ready`.

## If you touch SEO/deploy

Ship hero assets in the same dist you promote. A SEO-only promote that rebuilds from a tree without v24 will wipe the live cell again.
